# === OPTION 1: Gmail SMTP via Nodemailer ===
# Note: Google requires a 16-character App Password (not your normal Google password).
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification at https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate a 16-character password at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
MAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
MAIL_PASS=your-16-char-app-password
MAIL_FROM=your-email@gmail.com
MAIL_TO=destination-inbox@gmail.com

# === OPTION 2: Web3Forms (Alternative zero-config provider) ===
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key
